/*
 * User Accounts of the Control Panel: resources
 *
 * The Ukrainian words are Windows' own (usercpl.dll.mui, uk-UA) where it has
 * them, in the wording of Windows 7 for User Account Control ("контроль
 * облікових записів"); the icon is Windows' own too
 * (SystemResources\usercpl.dll.mun, the icon DefaultIcon points at). What is
 * about the Linux subsystem is Arctic's own (docs/linux-gate.md).
